                            "id": "aria-allowed-role",
                            "title": "Uses ARIA roles only on compatible elements",
                            "description": "Many HTML elements can only be assigned certain ARIA roles. Using ARIA roles where they are not allowed can interfere with the accessibility of the web page. [Learn more about ARIA roles](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/aria-allowed-role).",
