                            "title": "Image elements have `[alt]` attributes",
                            "description": "Informative elements should aim for short, descriptive alternate text. Decorative elements can be ignored with an empty alt attribute. [Learn more about the `alt` attribute](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.13/image-alt).",
                            "score": null,
                            "scoreDisplayMode": "notApplicable"
